    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/6de0ef21793e19e2c689310bebfd31d3.avif?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>&quot;Philgood&quot; is a new 2D adventure/puzzle game. <br>It stages a little character stucked in a white \u201cline\u201d\u00a0 !<br>Why did this happen ?  How to reach the end of this &quot;line&quot; much more alive than it seems ...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/6477284cb5a20b721d1f7fb24423f959.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br><strong><u>A reflection on the world for gamers who want to see further...!</u></strong><br>Behind an apparent simplicity lies a solid scenario, comparing the ideas, the point of views and criticisms of a Greek philosopher about his area (8th century BC), and the various abuses of our contemporary world with its socio-political-economic crises. Which shows there\u2019s nothing new under the sun ... or almost ! <br>A story filled of metaphors, mysteries and discoveries.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/bba4c806b7f2c58642cef4b7119b0fa3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>An unknown entity sends you to look for the bars of infinity scattered in the different Empires.<br>The only way for PhilGood to find his loved ones is to accept the challenge and follow the instructions given by this entity.<br>Fight every enemy, solve every riddle in order to overcome obstacles and get a little closer to the \u201ctruth\u201d.<br>But at every moment, your life hangs by a thread !<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/bba4c806b7f2c58642cef4b7119b0fa3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br><br>Its various gameplay requires reflection, skills, a fighting spirit, water and breath savings, speed and restraint to find clues and hidden messages, and to decode and solve the puzzles.<br><br>Another particularity of the game is the system of life reconstruction, especially resurrection in a parallel world, always well linked to the scenario. A system that allows the player never to be blocked while giving more variety.<br><br>And a special mention for the original, interesting and even suprising soundtrack\u00a0!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/3efc0eb30ea195680da982f2ec32f2f3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>.<br>.<br>.<br>.... And in the end, you believe you've seen everything, you believe you have all the keys.<br>And if the Empires were to hide another reality. <br>What is their true secret...!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/6de0ef21793e19e2c689310bebfd31d3.avif?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>&quot;Philgood&quot; is a new 2D adventure/puzzle game. <br>It stages a little character stucked in a white \u201cline\u201d\u00a0 !<br>Why did this happen ?  How to reach the end of this &quot;line&quot; much more alive than it seems ...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/6477284cb5a20b721d1f7fb24423f959.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br><strong><u>A reflection on the world for gamers who want to see further...!</u></strong><br>Behind an apparent simplicity lies a solid scenario, comparing the ideas, the point of views and criticisms of a Greek philosopher about his area (8th century BC), and the various abuses of our contemporary world with its socio-political-economic crises. Which shows there\u2019s nothing new under the sun ... or almost ! <br>A story filled of metaphors, mysteries and discoveries.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/bba4c806b7f2c58642cef4b7119b0fa3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>An unknown entity sends you to look for the bars of infinity scattered in the different Empires.<br>The only way for PhilGood to find his loved ones is to accept the challenge and follow the instructions given by this entity.<br>Fight every enemy, solve every riddle in order to overcome obstacles and get a little closer to the \u201ctruth\u201d.<br>But at every moment, your life hangs by a thread !<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/bba4c806b7f2c58642cef4b7119b0fa3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br><br>Its various gameplay requires reflection, skills, a fighting spirit, water and breath savings, speed and restraint to find clues and hidden messages, and to decode and solve the puzzles.<br><br>Another particularity of the game is the system of life reconstruction, especially resurrection in a parallel world, always well linked to the scenario. A system that allows the player never to be blocked while giving more variety.<br><br>And a special mention for the original, interesting and even suprising soundtrack\u00a0!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082620/extras/3efc0eb30ea195680da982f2ec32f2f3.webp?t=1667312356\" /></div><br>.<br>.<br>.<br>.... And in the end, you believe you've seen everything, you believe you have all the keys.<br>And if the Empires were to hide another reality. <br>What is their true secret...!",
